  "description": "WebSocketServer is lightweight and high performance WebSocket server library. Support route, full duplex communication, multiplexing, pipeline, encryption. WebSocketServer 是一个轻量级、高性能WebSocket服务端库。支持 WebApi 路由、全双工通信、多路复用、管道、加密等。",
